<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>StringsTable</key>
	<string>Root</string>
	<key>PreferenceSpecifiers</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>画面 · Display</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>上面的值都可以自由填写；重启游戏后生效。推荐组合：场景 1600x900 + 缓冲 1080（均衡），或场景 1280x720 + 缓冲 720（最省电）· free-form values; takes effect after relaunching. Recommended: scene 1600x900 + buffer 1080 (balanced), or scene 1280x720 + buffer 720 (coolest)</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSTextFieldSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_IOS_DRAWABLE_H</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>显示缓冲高度（推荐 1080）· Display buffer height</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>1080</string>
			<key>KeyboardType</key>
			<string>NumberPad</string>
			<key>AutoCapitalizationType</key>
			<string>None</string>
			<key>AutoCorrectionType</key>
			<string>None</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>这是最终画面的“行数”，不是屏幕像素：720 省电、画面略软；1080 推荐，文字清晰；0 = iPad 面板原生，最清晰也最热。在 2420x1668 的 iPad 上分别约 1281x883 / 1919x1323 / 2420x1668，也可填 240–4320 之间的任意值 · rows for the final picture, not screen pixels: 720 runs coolest and is softer; 1080 recommended; 0 = native panel, sharpest and hottest. On a 2420x1668 iPad these are about 1281x883 / 1919x1323 / 2420x1668; any height 240–4320 works</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSTextFieldSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_RENDER_RES</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>场景渲染分辨率（推荐 1600x900）· Scene render resolution</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>1600x900</string>
			<key>KeyboardType</key>
			<string>Alphabet</string>
			<key>AutoCapitalizationType</key>
			<string>None</string>
			<key>AutoCorrectionType</key>
			<string>None</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>WxH，只影响 3D 世界。推荐 1600x900（接近原作、60 帧稳定）。更省电：1280x720 / 960x540；更高画质：1920x1080（像素 +44%，更热）；2560x1440、2420x1668 需要包内 overlay，发热明显。没有对应 overlay 的尺寸会回退到 1600x900 · WxH, the 3D world only. 1600x900 recommended. Cooler: 1280x720 / 960x540. Sharper: 1920x1080 (+44% pixels, hotter); 2560x1440 and 2420x1668 need a bundled overlay and run hot. A size without its overlay falls back to 1600x900.</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_FPS_CAP</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>帧率上限 · Frame rate cap</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>60</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>120</string>
				<string>60</string>
				<string>30</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>120 帧（最热）</string>
				<string>60 帧（推荐）</string>
				<string>30 帧（省电）</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>60 使用真正的 60 Hz 显示节拍，ProMotion 也会降到 60，比 120 Hz 隔帧省电；30 走省电路径。重启游戏后生效 · 60 uses a real 60 Hz display link; 30 is the power-saving path; takes effect after relaunching</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_ASPECT</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>画面比例 · Aspect ratio</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>display</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>display</string>
				<string>0</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>填满屏幕 · Fill the screen</string>
				<string>16:9 · 黑边 · Letterbox</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>填满屏幕会把 16:9 画面延伸到 iPad 全屏，少数 UI 特效可能偏移（实验性）· fills the iPad screen; a few UI effects may sit off (experimental)</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>手柄与键盘 · Controller and keyboard</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_GYRO</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>手柄陀螺仪 · Controller gyroscope</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>需要带陀螺仪的手柄（DualSense / DualShock / Switch Pro）· needs a controller with a gyroscope</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_RUMBLE</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>手柄震动 · Controller rumble</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>需要支持 HD 震动的手柄 · needs a controller with haptics</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_KEYBOARD</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>妙控键盘 · Magic Keyboard</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string>auto</string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string>auto</string>
				<string>off</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>自动（连接时启用）</string>
				<string>关闭</string>
			</array>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>自动检测硬件键盘；关闭后只用触屏和手柄，防止键盘异常时无法操作 · detects a hardware keyboard; off keeps touch and controllers only</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_TOUCH_WITH_KEYBOARD</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>连接键盘时保留触屏 · Keep touch with a keyboard</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<false/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>默认像手柄一样收起触控层；打开后键盘和触屏同时可用 · the touch layer hides for a keyboard by default; on keeps both</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>存档 · Save</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_BACKUP</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>iCloud Drive 自动备份 · iCloud Drive backup</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>首次启用时 App 会让你选择一个 iCloud Drive 文件夹；save 和 game-slot 会自动镜像过去，删 App 也不会丢 · the app asks for an iCloud Drive folder once; save and game-slot are mirrored there and survive deleting the app</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>游戏语言 · Game language</string>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>重新启动游戏后生效 · takes effect after relaunching the game</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSRadioGroupSpecifier</string>
			<key>Key</key>
			<string>TOTK_LANG</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>語言 · Language</string>
			<key>DefaultValue</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>Values</key>
			<array>
				<string></string>
				<string>zh-Hant</string>
				<string>zh-Hans</string>
				<string>en-US</string>
				<string>ja</string>
				<string>de</string>
				<string>es</string>
				<string>fr</string>
				<string>it</string>
				<string>nl</string>
				<string>ru</string>
				<string>ko</string>
			</array>
			<key>Titles</key>
			<array>
				<string>自動 · 跟隨系統語言 · Follow system language</string>
				<string>繁體中文</string>
				<string>简体中文</string>
				<string>English</string>
				<string>日本語</string>
				<string>Deutsch</string>
				<string>Español</string>
				<string>Français</string>
				<string>Italiano</string>
				<string>Nederlands</string>
				<string>Русский</string>
				<string>한국어</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
